       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
identification division.
program-id. ABIPROBE.
data division.
working-storage section.
copy "ST-APP.cpy".
01 TEST-VALUE.
  05 VALUE-LENGTH PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
  05 VALUE-NULL PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
  05 FILLER PIC X(2).
  05 VALUE-DATA PIC X(1024).
01 RC PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 REQUEST-SIZE PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 RESULT-SIZE PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 VALUE-SIZE PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
procedure division.
    MOVE LENGTH OF ST-DB-REQUEST TO REQUEST-SIZE
    MOVE LENGTH OF ST-DB-RESULT TO RESULT-SIZE
    MOVE LENGTH OF TEST-VALUE TO VALUE-SIZE
    IF REQUEST-SIZE NOT = 976 OR RESULT-SIZE NOT = 40 OR VALUE-SIZE NOT = 1032
      DISPLAY "FAIL COPY sizes" STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    INITIALIZE ST-DB-REQUEST ST-DB-RESULT TEST-VALUE
    MOVE "ABI-PROBE" TO DB-COMMAND MOVE 2 TO DB-PARAMETER-COUNT
    MOVE 3 TO DB-TYPE(1) MOVE -1 TO DB-NULL(1)
    MOVE 5 TO DB-TYPE(2) MOVE 3 TO DB-LENGTH(2)
    MOVE "123" TO VALUE-DATA MOVE 3 TO VALUE-LENGTH
    SET DB-DATA(2) TO ADDRESS OF VALUE-DATA
    CALL "STABIVERIFY" USING ST-DB-REQUEST ST-DB-RESULT TEST-VALUE
      RETURNING RC END-CALL
    IF RC NOT = 0 OR DB-NATIVE NOT = 2601 OR DB-AFFECTED NOT = 123
      OR DB-SQLSTATE NOT = "23000" OR DB-ERROR NOT = 7
      OR DB-CURSOR = NULL OR VALUE-NULL NOT = -1
      DISPLAY "FAIL COBOL C roundtrip" STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    DISPLAY "PASS COPY C pointer int32 int64 NULL roundtrip"
    STOP RUN RETURNING 0.
end program ABIPROBE.
